   [Tags]    FULL_RUN     10MHZ    2574   2574_A5
   ...       CRT
   [Documentation]     Cellsetup Dss phase 3, BW= 10MHz, DL RATIO = 100%, superfast_allocation activated, NSA 5g Call , DL Tput
   ...                 Check csi_ReportingBand in SgNBAdditionRequestAcknowledge
   ...                 Check numOfPrb / startSymbol / rat0Bitmap in ICOM_5G/DlData_PdschSendReq based on CatMInfo received by CRM
